! A LOST TRAVELLER  (1986)
! I.  Departure
!
! Manuscript for CDGEN.  A. Fredericks, VAXstation II, December 1985.
!
! Eight chords, two bars each, played three times over the sound of the
! sea: the first time the pads alone, then the bells and a melody, then
! the plucked strings.  D Dorian, sixty to the minute.
!
TITLE	Departure
TEMPO	60
REVERB	35
SPACE	85
MASTER	130
TAIL	9

VOICE 1 SINE   LEVEL 60 PAN 50 ATTACK 3000 DECAY 0 SUSTAIN 100 RELEASE 4000 GATE 100
VOICE 2 PAD    LEVEL 38 PAN 25 ATTACK 3500 SUSTAIN 90 RELEASE 5000 DETUNE 6
VOICE 3 PAD    LEVEL 36 PAN 50 ATTACK 4000 SUSTAIN 90 RELEASE 5000 DETUNE 8
VOICE 4 PAD    LEVEL 34 PAN 75 ATTACK 4500 SUSTAIN 90 RELEASE 5000 DETUNE 5
VOICE 5 BELL   LEVEL 34 PAN 80 RATIO 3.5 INDEX 3 DECAY 6000 RELEASE 6000
VOICE 6 PLUCK  LEVEL 50 PAN 30 DAMP 98 RELEASE 400
VOICE 7 FM     LEVEL 40 PAN 60 RATIO 1 INDEX 1.2 ATTACK 600 DECAY 2000 SUSTAIN 70 RELEASE 1500 GATE 95
VOICE 8 NOISE  LEVEL 20 PAN 50 ATTACK 3000 SUSTAIN 80 RELEASE 4500 GATE 70

! The bass: one note to each chord.
!           Dm9       Bbmaj7      Fmaj7     Cadd9     Dm        Gm7       Asus4     A
