	A3/1~ A3/1
PART 4	P  |: E4/1~ E4/1  D4/1~ D4/1  E4/1~ E4/1  E4/1~ E4/1  D4/1~ D4/1  D4/1~ D4/1  D4/1~ D4/1  C#4/1~ C#4/1 :|3
